    "description": "<p>This Charm takes the form of a series of Essenceinjection nozzles fed into its prerequisite. When activated, it allows the Exalt to take a reflexive Jump action, even if she is in midair at the time. The character can extend the length of an ordinary jump, change direction in midair, arrest his momentum while falling (effectively resetting the distance fallen at the time of the Charm's use) or break a flurry as in Leaping Dodge Method (see Exalted, p. 227). In the latter case, the effect is considered a special counterattack. This Charm may be activated only once per action.</p>",
